<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="command">cooldowns</ansi>

Some abilities are powerful enough that they cannot be
used every round. After using such an ability, it enters
a cooldown period. You must wait for the cooldown to
expire before using that ability again.

<ansi fg="yellow">Special Combat Moves: </ansi>

Special moves (<ansi fg="command">bash</ansi>, <ansi fg="command">trip</ansi>, <ansi fg="command">kick</ansi> and the like), spells
and shots with <ansi fg="command">fire</ansi> share a single cooldown. <ansi fg="command">consider</ansi> uses it too. Using any one of
them prevents you from using the others until the
cooldown expires. This encourages tactical timing rather
than chaining knockdown attempts. See <ansi fg="command">help special</ansi>.

<ansi fg="yellow">Usage: </ansi>

  <ansi fg="command">cooldowns</ansi> - Display your active cooldowns

